{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And he shall flay.</b> Since we find regarding the bulls that are burned and the goats that are burned that everything is burned — skin, flesh, and dung — it was necessary to explain here: even though it is entirely an olah-offering and is burned, it requires flaying, and the skin is not burned."], :book :leviticus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:07:50.887378817Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}